title: State Machine — Warranty (MF-05 HEADHUNT_COD)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> ACTIVE : Placement started (HEADHUNT_COD)
  ACTIVE --> PASSED : Warranty period ends (worker)
  ACTIVE --> CLAIMED : Client reports early resignation
  CLAIMED --> ACTIVE : Internal HR rejects claim
  CLAIMED --> VOIDED : Internal HR confirms resignation
  PASSED --> [*]
  VOIDED --> [*]
